      "methodology": "TAC 2008 defines 48 news topics, each with 20 relevant AQUAINT-2 documents ordered chronologically and divided into ten-document Set A and later ten-document Set B. Systems generate a maximum 100-word initial Summary A and a 100-word update Summary B under the assumption that the reader already knows Set A, while NIST assessors also create human model summaries. Seventy-one automatic runs were scored with ROUGE-2, ROUGE-SU4 and BE-HM, and 57 runs received manual readability, Pyramid-content and overall-responsiveness evaluation, followed by statistical comparisons and correlation analysis.",
